"welcome.gpg.title" = "GPG (PGP signing) — optional";
"welcome.gpg.body" = "GPG lets you sign archives so recipients can verify origin and integrity, and lets you encrypt to specific recipients' public keys. Entirely optional — turning it off keeps SimpleZip behaving as if GPG isn't there at all; you can opt in here anytime.";
"welcome.gpg.enable" = "Enable GPG integration";
"welcome.gpg.enable.description" = "When on: the Create Archive sheet exposes a \"GPG sign\" option, opening a .siz shows signer info, and Settings → GPG can manage keys. When off: every GPG entry point disappears from the main UI.";
